From: Khovanskiy <a@khovanskiy.ru>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 11:01:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] cmake: build with CMake 4

CMake 4 removed compatibility with cmake_minimum_required below 3.5:
'Compatibility with CMake < 3.5 has been removed from CMake', and the
build worked only with CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 in the
environment. The range 3.5...3.10 keeps old CMake working and silences
the deprecation warning of CMake 4.
---
 CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index eca6ae9..452b217 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.8 FATAL_ERROR)
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5...3.10 FATAL_ERROR)
 
 project(pg C)
 if(NOT CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE)
